1
00:00:00,905 --> 00:00:02,915
Your devices live in different worlds.

2
00:00:04,105 --> 00:00:06,625
And sharing between them?
It shouldn't be this hard.

3
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:12,050
Meet CrossDrop. Share anything,
with any device nearby.

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:16,320
One app, on every device. Mac,
Android, iPhone, and Windows.

5
00:00:18,555 --> 00:00:21,795
Open it, and nearby devices
simply appear on your radar.

6
00:00:22,505 --> 00:00:24,525
No pairing. No accounts. No cables.

7
00:00:27,075 --> 00:00:28,775
Tap a device, pick your photos,

8
00:00:29,355 --> 00:00:34,105
and they fly across at full Wi-Fi speed.
Device to device, never through the cloud.

9
00:00:34,155 --> 00:00:35,055
Done.

10
00:00:36,155 --> 00:00:39,425
End-to-end encrypted. Nothing
in between. Not even us.

11
00:00:40,205 --> 00:00:41,525
Edited a huge video?

12
00:00:42,055 --> 00:00:43,445
Only the changes travel.

13
00:00:44,675 --> 00:00:45,655
Wi-Fi dropped?

14
00:00:45,705 --> 00:00:47,385
It picks up right where it left off.

15
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,780
No app? No problem.

16
00:00:50,155 --> 00:00:53,905
Anyone nearby can scan the code,
and download right in their browser.

17
00:00:56,345 --> 00:00:58,265
Turn your phone into a wireless drive.

18
00:00:58,330 --> 00:01:00,550
Browse it from any Mac, PC, or browser,

19
00:01:00,675 --> 00:01:02,795
and stream videos without copying a thing.

20
00:01:03,055 --> 00:01:06,055
No cloud. No accounts.
No ads. No tracking.

21
00:01:06,105 --> 00:01:07,055
Just drop it.

22
00:01:08,485 --> 00:01:11,970
CrossDrop. Available on
Android, iOS, Mac, and Windows.
